          "language": "java",
          "content": "// Java 用户代码约定:顶层 User 类,无 import(壳已预置 java.util/gson)\nclass User {\n    public static Map<String, Object> main(Map<String, Object> params) {\n        String summary = String.valueOf(params.get(\"summary\"));\n        Map<String, Object> out = new HashMap<>();\n        out.put(\"report\", \"[java] \" + summary + \" — polyglot ok\");\n        out.put(\"chars\", summary.length());\n        System.err.println(\"{\\\"level\\\":\\\"log\\\",\\\"msg\\\":\\\"[java] summarized\\\"}\");\n        return out;\n    }\n}\n"
        },
